# Avacyn, Angel of Horror: "Whenever Avacyn or another nontoken creature you control dies" - "nontoken" qualifies only
# "another ... creature"; "Avacyn" is the object itself, whatever it is (CR 700.4, 603.10a). Bot2 casts Avacyn; Bot1's
# Fractured Identity exiles it and Bot1 gets a token copy, its only Avacyn (so the legend rule, CR 704.5j, has nothing to
# choose between). Damnation kills that token: its dies ability still triggers and the delayed return is set up
# (Delayed.Count = 1), but a token ceases to exist in the graveyard (CR 111.7, 704.5d), so at the end step nothing comes
# back: Bot2's Avacyn stays in exile and Bot1 has no Avacyn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Fractured Identity
Damnation
Swamp
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Island
Avacyn, Angel of Horror
Island x12

